BCC_Q({"y": 2025, "n": 9, "part": "B", "topic": "logic", "title": "Beaver Gates", "answer": 1, "story": "<p>Gates are placed on two types of platforms.<\/p>\n<p>A gate on a circle platform <img alt=\"\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" style=\"width:0.69444in; vertical-align:bottom;\"/> will only open if there are at least two beavers standing on the\ncircle platform.<\/p>\n<p>A gate on a square platform <img alt=\"\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" style=\"width:0.69444in; vertical-align:bottom;\"/> will only open if there is at least one beaver standing on the square\nplatform.<\/p>\n<p>Beavers walk along marked paths until they reach a platform. If the\ngate doesn't open, they wait on the platform. If the gate opens, then\nall beavers standing on the platform go through the gate and continue\nwalking along the marked paths.<\/p>", "question": "<p>In which situation will the gate labelled <span class=\"math inline\">\\(G\\)<\/span> stay closed?<\/p>\n<ol class=\"mc\">\n<li> <img alt=\"One beaver walks along a top path that passes through a gate on a circle platform. One beaver walks along a bottom path that passes through a gate on a square platform. Beyond these gates, the top and bottom paths merge at a gate labelled G on a square platform.\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" style=\"width:3.47222in; vertical-align:middle;\"/> <\/li>\n<li> <img alt=\"One beaver walks along a top path that passes through a gate on a circle platform. One beaver walks along a bottom path that passes through a gate on a square platform. Beyond these gates, the top and bottom paths merge at a gate labelled G on a circle platform.\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" style=\"width:3.47222in; vertical-align:middle;\"/> <\/li>\n<li> <img alt=\"No beavers walk along a top path that passes through a gate on a square platform. Two beavers walk along a bottom path that passes through a gate on a circle platform. Beyond these gates, the top and bottom paths merge at a gate labelled G on a circle platform.\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" style=\"width:3.47222in; vertical-align:middle;\"/> <\/li>\n<li> <img alt=\"One beaver walks along a top path that passes through a gate on a square platform. One beaver walks along a bottom path that passes through a gate on a square platform. Beyond these gates, the top and bottom paths merge at a gate labelled G on a circle platform.\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" style=\"width:3.47222in; vertical-align:middle;\"/> <\/li>\n<\/ol>", "answerHtml": "<p>(B) <img alt=\"One beaver walks along a top path that passes through a gate on a circle platform. One beaver walks along a bottom path that passes through a gate on a square platform. Beyond these gates, the top and bottom paths merge at a gate labelled G on a circle platform.\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" style=\"width:3.47222in; vertical-align:middle;\"/> <\/p>", "explanation": "<p>In Option A the top beaver has to wait on the circle platform, but\nthe bottom beaver proceeds to open gate <span class=\"math inline\">\\(G\\)<\/span>.<\/p>\n<div class=\"center\">\n<p> <img alt=\"\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" style=\"width:3.47222in\"/> <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>In Option C both beavers go through the gate on the circle platform\nand proceed together to open gate <span class=\"math inline\">\\(G\\)<\/span>.<\/p>\n<div class=\"center\">\n<p> <img alt=\"\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" style=\"width:3.47222in\"/> <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>In Option D both beavers go through the gates on the square platforms\nand proceed together to open gate <span class=\"math inline\">\\(G\\)<\/span>.<\/p>\n<div class=\"center\">\n<p> <img alt=\"\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" style=\"width:3.47222in\"/> <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>However, in Option B one beaver goes through the gate on the square\nplatform, but the other beaver has to wait on the circle platform.\nTherefore, only one beaver proceeds to the gate <span class=\"math inline\">\\(G\\)<\/span> on the circle platform so gate <span class=\"math inline\">\\(G\\)<\/span> stays closed.<\/p>\n<div class=\"center\">\n<p> <img alt=\"\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" style=\"width:3.47222in\"/> <\/p>\n<\/div>", "connections": "", "mc": 1});